                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you are looking for a pure horror experience, this is not for you.\n\nIf you are looking for a puzzle riddled adventure game, filled with challenging but rewarding gameplay loops, this is not for you either.\n\nBut if you are looking for a cool experience, filled with artistic expression, some horror elements, some easy puzzle elements, surreal landscapes, symbolism and that touch of Romanian/Balkan Orthodox church look and feel, telling a rather basic, but not bad story, give this a go.\n\nBonus if you are from the Balkans and lived through the experience of visiting your Orthodox grandparents in the countryside, than you can add a massive dose of nostalgia to the mix.\n\nWorth a go in my opinion!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792271483,
